      "name": "Club",
      "quantity": 1,
      "description": "<p>This is a piece of stout wood shaped or repurposed to bludgeon an enemy. Clubs can be intricately carved pieces of martial art or as simple as a tree branch or piece of wood.</p>",
      "level": 0,
      "price": "",
      "traits": [
